        "description": "<div id=\"link_wrapped_content\">\n<body><section class=\"wp-block-bigbite-multi-title\"><div class=\"container\"></div></section>\n\n\n\n<p>Some back-to-school purchases are no-brainers, like <a href=\"https://www.pcworld.com/article/557622/the-best-laptop-for-college.html\">a new laptop or Chromebook</a>. But other helpful products aren\u2019t always as obvious. They can seem purely optional\u2014stuff to buy when you have money to burn.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>But don\u2019t brush off the various tech gadgets and accessories out there, especially if you\u2019re often zigzagging across a college campus. Add in part-time work and the demands of a social life, and the right gear can help you keep your sanity and stay on track.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Here are over a dozen affordable tech gadgets now available that I wish <em>I</em> had in school. They would\u2019ve made life a lot easier!</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-idg-base-theme-listicle-chart-block wp-block-product-chart product-chart\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-listicle-chart\"><div class=\"wp-block-li",
